                                "sense_id": "d5b1cf1d-573a-3f88-83ca-77b749a61d65",
                                "text": "Standing on the corner like a just-got-in-town jasper / I'm on a street corner with a gasper"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45b3851b-e41a-4b72-8b39-7b90abb158ea",
                                "sense_id": "d5b1cf1d-573a-3f88-83ca-77b749a61d65",
                                "text": "The engineer shivers in the bright chill and lights a gasper of his own and tells Madame Psychosis through the intercom that the whole range of levels is fine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b2530d4-f954-45f4-914a-6385d02d6249",
                                "sense_id": "d5b1cf1d-573a-3f88-83ca-77b749a61d65",
